.TH WORLDBISECTD 8 "August 2026" "WorldBisect 1.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
worldbisectd \- authenticated WorldBisect API and job worker daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B worldbisectd init
.RI [ options ]
.PP
.B worldbisectd run
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
worldbisectd initializes secure local configuration and runs the HTTP API, embedded dashboard, audit service, and bounded persistent worker queue.
.SH SECURITY
The default listener is loopback-only and remote execution is disabled. Expose the daemon remotely only behind an independently managed TLS reverse proxy and network policy.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/worldbisect/config.json
Daemon configuration.
.TP
.I /var/lib/worldbisect
Persistent data, signing keys, captures, analyses, jobs, traces, and audit records.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR worldbisect (1),
.BR worldbisect.conf (5)
